<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start min-h-screen bg-orange-50 px-4 pt-5">
  <div class="text-4xl text-center font-bold">
    <h1>パスワードを忘れた方へ</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-1 text-3xl text-center font-bold">
    <h1>パスワード再設定メール送信</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-md mt-4 p-4 font-bold bg-white border border-red-500 rounded-lg text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      ご本人でのお手続きが難しい場合は、<br>
      ご登録のメールアドレスをご存知のご家族が<br>
      代わりに再設定を行うこともできます。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-md text-3xl text-gray-700">
    <%= form_for(resource, as: resource_name, url: password_path(resource_name), html: { method: :post }) do |f| %>
      <%= render "devise/shared/error_messages", resource: resource %>

      <div class="field mt-4 mb-5">
        <p class="font-bold mb-1"><%= f.label :email %></p>
        <p><%= f.email_field :email, autofocus: true, autocomplete: "email", class: "w-full p-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-white focus:outline-orange-500"  %></p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <%= f.submit "送信する", class: "mb-10 w-75 mx-auto flex justify-center items-center px-10 py-6 text-3xl text-center text-white bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-300 font-bold rounded-lg cursor-pointer" %>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-4 text-sm">
        <%= render "devise/shared/links" %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>